msgid "Due-date notifications"
msgstr "Recordatoris de venciment"

msgid ""
"KanbanMF can e-mail you about cards that are due soon or overdue. "
"Reminders are personal and per board: you decide for yourself, board by "
"board, whether you want them and when. Turning them on never subscribes "
"anyone else."
msgstr ""
"KanbanMF us pot enviar correus sobre les targetes que vencen aviat o que "
"estan endarrerides. Els recordatoris són personals i per tauler: decidiu "
"vosaltres, tauler per tauler, si els voleu i quan. Activar-los mai "
"subscriu ningú més."

msgid "Setting up your reminders for a board"
msgstr "Configurar els recordatoris d'un tauler"

msgid ""
"Open the board's menu — on its tile in the boards overview, or the ☰ at "
"the right of the board's bar — and choose :guilabel:`E-Mail "
"notification`."
msgstr ""
"Obriu el menú del tauler —a la seva fitxa de la vista general, o el ☰ de "
"la dreta de la barra del tauler— i trieu :guilabel:`Notificacions per "
"correu`."

msgid "The My e-mail notifications dialog with reminders turned on."
msgstr ""
"El diàleg Les meves notificacions per correu amb els recordatoris "
"activats."

msgid "Reminders for one board."
msgstr "Recordatoris d'un tauler."

msgid ""
"Every change in this dialog is saved immediately; :guilabel:`Close` just "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Cada canvi en aquest diàleg es desa immediatament; :guilabel:`Tanca` "
"només el tanca."

msgid ":guilabel:`E-mail me about my due dates on this board`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Envia'm un correu sobre les meves dates de venciment en aquest"
" tauler`"

msgid ""
"Turns your reminders for this board on or off. The other settings appear "
"once it is on."
msgstr ""
"Activa o desactiva els vostres recordatoris d'aquest tauler. La resta "
"d'opcions apareixen quan està activat."

msgid ":guilabel:`Notification hour`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Hora de la notificació`"

msgid ""
"The hour of the day the e-mails are sent, in your own time zone (see "
":doc:`preferences`)."
msgstr ""
"L'hora del dia en què s'envien els correus, en el vostre fus horari "
"(vegeu :doc:`preferences`)."

msgid ":guilabel:`Send e-mails on`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Envia correus els`"

msgid ""
"The days of the week e-mails may be sent on — Monday to Friday by "
"default. A reminder that falls on any other day is skipped, not "
"postponed."
msgstr ""
"Els dies de la setmana en què es poden enviar correus; per defecte, de "
"dilluns a divendres. Un recordatori que caigui en qualsevol altre dia no "
"s'envia, i no s'ajorna."

msgid ":guilabel:`Notify these days before/after the due date`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Notifica aquests dies abans/després de la data de venciment`"

msgid ""
"Type a number and click **+** to add it. Negative numbers are days "
"*before* the due date, ``0`` is the day itself and positive numbers are "
"days after it. For example ``-3``, ``-1`` and ``0`` remind you three days"
" before, the day before, and on the day. Click the cross on a number to "
"remove it."
msgstr ""
"Escriviu un número i feu clic a **+** per afegir-lo. Els números negatius"
" són dies *abans* de la data de venciment, ``0`` és el mateix dia i els "
"positius són dies després. Per exemple, ``-3``, ``-1`` i ``0`` us ho "
"recorden tres dies abans, el dia abans i el mateix dia. Feu clic a la "
"creu d'un número per treure'l."

msgid ":guilabel:`Send e-mails daily past … days the due date`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Envia correus diaris passada la … dies la data de venciment`"

msgid ""
"Tick it and enter a number to keep getting a reminder every day once a "
"card is that many days overdue, until it is finished."
msgstr ""
"Marqueu-ho i escriviu un número per continuar rebent un recordatori cada "
"dia quan una targeta porti aquests dies de retard, fins que s'acabi."

msgid "Which cards you are reminded about"
msgstr "Sobre quines targetes rebeu recordatoris"

msgid "Only cards on that board that:"
msgstr "Només de les targetes d'aquell tauler que:"

msgid "have you as an **assignee** — being a member is not enough;"
msgstr "us tenen com a **assignat** —ser-ne membre no n'hi ha prou—;"

msgid ""
"have a due date and **no end date** — once a card has an end date it is "
"finished and the reminders stop;"
msgstr ""
"tenen data de venciment i **no tenen data de finalització**: quan una "
"targeta té data de finalització està acabada i els recordatoris s'aturen;"

msgid "are not archived."
msgstr "no estan arxivades."

msgid ""
"Each e-mail is about one card. Its subject names the card and the board "
"and says how the card stands — due in a number of days, due today, or a "
"number of days late — and it links to the board. It is written in your "
"language."
msgstr ""
"Cada correu tracta d'una targeta. L'assumpte diu el nom de la targeta i "
"del tauler i com està la targeta —venç d'aquí a uns dies, venç avui o "
"porta uns dies de retard—, i el correu enllaça amb el tauler. S'escriu en"
" el vostre idioma."

msgid ""
"You get at most one e-mail per card per day, even if several of your "
"rules match on the same day."
msgstr ""
"Rebeu com a màxim un correu per targeta i per dia, encara que el mateix "
"dia coincideixin unes quantes de les vostres regles."

msgid "When nothing arrives"
msgstr "Quan no arriba res"

msgid ""
"Check the e-mail days and the hour: reminders go out at the start of the "
"chosen hour, only on the chosen days."
msgstr ""
"Comproveu els dies i l'hora dels correus: els recordatoris surten al "
"començament de l'hora triada, només els dies triats."

msgid "Check that you are an assignee of the card and that it has no end date."
msgstr "Comproveu que sou assignat de la targeta i que no té data de finalització."

msgid ""
"Reminders need the server to be able to send e-mail. If whoever runs your"
" KanbanMF hasn't set that up, no reminders are sent at all."
msgstr ""
"Els recordatoris necessiten que el servidor pugui enviar correus. Si qui "
"administra el vostre KanbanMF no ho ha configurat, no s'envia cap "
"recordatori."

